# CT9: switching module from the Categories app bar does NOT reload the category item grid

Repro: on Categories tab (Grocery & Food module, Dairy & Eggs selected, grid showing Bin Salem
Grocery / Shanklish Market / Baqala Lamat Al Taj / Abu Nadia Grocery Cream Cheese cards), tap
"Pharmacy" in the app-bar module switcher.

Observed:
- Category RAIL correctly reloads to Pharmacy categories (Personal Care, First Aid, Vitamins &
  Supplements, Cold & Flu, Pain Relief) -- see bug-ct9-module-switch-stale-grid.png.
- Category GRID does NOT reload -- same Grocery/Dairy & Eggs "Cream Cheese" cards remain visible
  underneath the now-Pharmacy category rail.
- adb logcat during the switch shows NO /api/v1/categories/childes/* or /api/v1/categories/items/*
  request fired after the module switch -- only a generic Home-module refresh batch fires
  (campaigns, banners, flash-sales, items/popular, items/basic, items/recommended, stores/get-stores).

module_switched itself fires correctly (from_module=Grocery & Food, to_module=Pharmacy,
from_module_id=1, to_module_id=3, source=categories_app_bar) -- see bug-analytics-context-mismatch.log
for its own screen/section defect.

Confirmed NOT a cold-start issue: force-stop + relaunch (module persisted as Pharmacy) lands
Categories correctly on Pharmacy items (Lip Balm, Hand Sanitizer, Family Health Pharmacy, Green
Cross Pharmacy) -- the INITIAL load binds to the current module fine. Only the LIVE in-place
switch fails to refetch the Categories screen's own state.

AC violated: CT9 "categories reload per module" -- the grid half of "categories" does not.
